                  <nc xml:id="m-baa7a14a-9aca-47ea-9a23-9c4042515c55" pname="d" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-5076e867-b5f7-402e-b3e3-3061f4497eca" pname="c" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-51d53175-2131-435d-ab4a-586da2c136c2" facs="#m-47fcb22e-6ac9-47e0-9fe8-74960fc42c0d" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d49cfe8c-d887-4c7b-9679-989bcb813be0"><lg xml:id="m-3e28852d-aeec-4400-afe1-b811725c4fb5"><l xml:id="m-fa369c38-ae40-4b25-87b4-d1b68a473261" facs="#m-6ba6150a-7b85-4b53-bffd-8b3912454c52" label="ambiguous">1e13</l><l xml:id="m-74cf014f-ce62-4868-ae1c-0d47e4f4caf1" facs="#m-1560a17d-16cf-4afb-8cc8-ade862c0ada8" label="ambiguous">August 24.</l><l xml:id="m-a85b9d52-a4fe-472d-8e4c-be32a482a70d" facs="#m-129f06af-1c90-4a9c-88a2-d432ced552dd" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Corinthios. I. Cor. 12. d.</l><l xml:id="m-b4d7e774-ef7f-44ac-934c-3e32e01c0d7a" facs="#m-0e797b4a-bc71-46fb-a0ef-27a62ba1d6ba" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Vos estis corpus Chri¬ mónum. Numquid omnes apóstoli?</l><l xml:id="m-974cc0cd-05a5-44df-a9ad-ff1fd2fee0e4" facs="#m-af088dcc-6f96-4ee5-a8ed-fc45e73be6f2" label="lyrics-like">sti, et membra de membro. Et! numquid omnes prophétae? num¬</l><l xml:id="m-c89d78c7-3e97-4d4f-86ec-1c7a5e454c90" facs="#m-8f248f84-6e9a-40d3-b911-55454548f273" label="lyrics-like">quid omnes doctóres? numquid</l><l xml:id="m-c3877f64-41fd-4f1a-b179-f54c634479e9" facs="#m-498c4bc5-0871-4efd-b87c-27af39a58b5c" label="lyrics-like">quosdam quidem pósuit Deus in</l><l xml:id="m-80ab8558-84d0-49d2-a6d4-caad223e55a8" facs="#m-2721091f-7f33-4e80-92ca-ca3ce03b70dc" label="lyrics-like">omnes virtútes? numquid omnes</l><l xml:id="m-baede455-cae5-47e0-bd3d-211b17900b42" facs="#m-e90c89fd-b02d-4181-b41d-9a6b79316d5c" label="lyrics-like">Écclésia primum apóstolos, secúndo</l><l xml:id="m-49b301fa-8d98-4880-b44f-5f0cda5ada0b" facs="#m-343cf9a6-8f33-4163-bb71-dc08e0b642a6" label="lyrics-like">prophétas, tértio doctóres, deinde</l><l xml:id="m-7b36289e-496e-49e7-a96a-68809254e936" facs="#m-9e2f6c07-7ad9-408d-b58c-aa9f1b47161f" label="lyrics-like">grátiam habent curatiónum? num¬</l><l xml:id="m-96b5cbbf-86e7-4390-b207-858365f80d69" facs="#m-2c65bf95-5292-4a4e-9090-66f0266cf381" label="lyrics-like">virtútes, exinde grátias curatiónum,</l><l xml:id="m-72d6f8ff-2d5f-4e6a-a116-d7e5fda5f38f" facs="#m-4f1ebd12-e14e-4fc8-b846-9a28cd97a5f5" label="lyrics-like">quid omnes linguis loquúntur ? num¬</l><l xml:id="m-4734a03a-c073-446e-bf4d-055d2020c5f1" facs="#m-49473ec2-b710-4bbe-acf5-cd1d859f325e" label="lyrics-like">quid omnes interpretántur? Æmulá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4751f308-760d-4fae-b352-bd79f636921f" facs="#m-e51216cc-84cf-4c44-a65c-5df87641d273" label="lyrics-like">opitulatiónes, gubernatiónes, géne¬</l><l xml:id="m-8918d7ef-f788-4119-a681-2ba076e540e7" facs="#m-cebd88f5-cdd6-4c62-af93-634d0a09836c" label="lyrics-like">ra linguárum, interpretatiónes ser- mini autem charismata melióra.</l><l xml:id="m-77a1fdfc-1fde-4972-ae6a-2ddebf62a1b8" facs="#m-079b04b4-c417-43f2-bda7-b6bc6dc4d26b" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Constitues éos. p. 1519.</l><l xml:id="m-8073634f-fa5a-4e2c-9edd-ebfb147948de" facs="#m-8197e1b4-c25b-4de1-a451-61d6f519adc0" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-ebed0fbe-74be-4b1c-a331-415466015a19" facs="#m-e0a00cd8-fc01-4328-a6d6-16f54bb87561" label="lyrics-like">H Le láe</l><l xml:id="m-2f75ec23-320b-4b5a-95d3-25d16d459476" facs="#m-cf5ec563-9be4-4670-9102-7c9236787df8" label="ambiguous">ia." ij.</l><l xml:id="m-32ee8479-3314-4fed-a1c5-a4caab50e85c" facs="#m-d024c2f8-e01c-400f-8807-b6a92cb2aaae" label="lyrics-like">V. Te glo-ri-ósus</l><l xml:id="m-b66bd718-4bb1-4c74-9029-463ce126e12d" facs="#m-19179dc9-4252-448c-92c7-572f94c28e55" label="lyrics-like">Aposto-ló- rum chó-rus</l><l xml:id="m-eed4aea2-4a92-46dd-9b0b-b53a2f5e5acc" facs="#m-6cff5345-4e77-4359-9f52-bed3a347788b" label="lyrics-like">láu¬</l><l xml:id="m-4cde1aa2-68e7-4d30-8ee4-c7ae7a2dd88c" facs="#m-eb2cef8c-5e53-4408-8bb6-baa14ec61950" label="lyrics-like">dat, “Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-fc52e183-3b19-4c0f-8e04-2fdb7bb06cc4" facs="#m-088a7ade-cf20-4abf-926c-bb7dc9271348" label="ambiguous">mi- ne.</l><l xml:id="m-03b144e1-c763-4170-ac5c-319676ec7d1f" facs="#m-5ec88a92-1cc9-463d-85a3-dbe0e9894d9a" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 6. b.</l><l xml:id="m-86bed10d-e168-4dd1-a313-f178cee54810" facs="#m-97dcbe15-9f12-4432-b2e5-581be7d6f701" label="lyrics-like">TN illo témpore: Exiit Jesus in ditor. Et descéndens cum illis, ste¬</l><l xml:id="m-41ddc360-c9fa-4bb2-9561-6e66b1395113" facs="#m-99d4957f-5b23-457f-8a34-9fa355b1b2f4" label="lyrics-like">L montem orâre, et erat pernó- tit in loco campéstri, et turba disci¬</l><l xml:id="m-5ecbead2-d6ac-4b19-ab8a-53a15327b610" facs="#m-e6809ddd-c87b-43d7-a4b0-5fb6ef826f52" label="lyrics-like">ctans in oratióne Dei. Et cum dies</l><l xml:id="m-dfc210e3-7e46-4234-a888-5e04e993d701" facs="#m-565d2e92-7f7b-4d51-af24-7581d1ec47c9" label="lyrics-like">pulórum ejus, et multitúdo copiósa</l><l xml:id="m-88056fab-bd90-4ad0-9297-5d83ee11ec49" facs="#m-d2bbccd7-45cd-4ec8-b5f8-65ffc80bca9a" label="lyrics-like">plebis ab omni Judaéa, et Jerú¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a6c6e0d-b351-4ab4-8d90-fecb07c0980c" facs="#m-7fb55afd-76e5-4ab9-b111-090e862e1e99" label="lyrics-like">factus esset, vocávit discípulos suos,</l><l xml:id="m-7aab91ca-7e80-4b98-ba3b-1b136b28f82c" facs="#m-15a95ed8-3e3a-4a55-b512-7e8a1ec7da6d" label="ambiguous">salem, et maritima, et Tyri, et</l><l xml:id="m-81d9db91-5585-4b85-a1ab-26b0c43cb998" facs="#m-8cc2eef1-7794-4920-8e7c-ac7b812526d5" label="lyrics-like">et elégit duódecim ex ipsis (quos et</l><l xml:id="m-9e64362e-20c0-49ab-a55a-ccfe04edaac0" facs="#m-060296c7-b5bf-4856-a1a0-1f3f74a149bf" label="lyrics-like">Apóstolos nominávit) Simónem,</l><l xml:id="m-508bf1f2-ca75-4f25-ae6a-5af095dff1e7" facs="#m-3f705950-7982-4cd3-873e-17ee0f2ce717" label="lyrics-like">Sidónis, qui vénerant ut audírent</l><l xml:id="m-a9be38e2-37e9-4026-a9da-2bf1fc1a315f" facs="#m-8ee3f526-4ebe-49fc-8322-62f1fb9ececc" label="lyrics-like">quem cognominávit Petrum, et An¬</l><l xml:id="m-f8d0bc67-bd20-4163-ac38-d6e02c59d937" facs="#m-725cfd71-b23d-4ee5-8fae-b2dad94a1d30" label="lyrics-like">eum, et sanaréntur a languóribus</l><l xml:id="m-0795ec6d-1d0a-4e23-9a8a-b063f1045121" facs="#m-63ccb31f-6529-40e8-b432-bea7413f2db3" label="lyrics-like">dréam fratrem ejus, Jacóbum et</l><l xml:id="m-e697903c-a801-4929-be74-e0789d830576" facs="#m-2b851029-1cd1-47aa-bbb3-ec3f49619951" label="lyrics-like">suis. Et qui vexabántur a spiritibus</l><l xml:id="m-74b7d5a1-3f65-4cf3-86da-cbe0dde19b8b" facs="#m-a02448cc-567b-4b67-92ec-2719bbbad684" label="lyrics-like">Joánnem, Philippum et Bartholo¬</l><l xml:id="m-45b642eb-13bd-4288-8297-b962e55f3023" facs="#m-468415d7-c6e3-4b5e-9a77-1a8784447982" label="lyrics-like">immúndis, curabántur. Et omnis</l><l xml:id="m-229eaabc-b824-4575-8192-6151fea3310e" facs="#m-3d349f76-b00a-4d6c-b53a-0ad1ba3fcc4c" label="lyrics-like">maéum, Matthaéum et Thomam,</l><l xml:id="m-9f1603a6-a7c0-4f85-a4e1-c79960117e43" facs="#m-6c2ba7c2-ff7f-4710-85aa-3a424212e20a" label="lyrics-like">turba quaerébat eum tángere, quia</l><l xml:id="m-76093e8c-8bae-4d0e-8053-1e56f970350f" facs="#m-201c40b5-a0f9-4a89-aa33-0382cfe223ed" label="lyrics-like">Jacóbum Alphaéi, et Simónem, qui</l><l xml:id="m-cab32993-4078-4e91-ad29-da8b840b0540" facs="#m-a57e7ce6-db59-4a17-bdd7-39b6f8c76ee5" label="lyrics-like">virtus de illo exíbat, et sanábat</l><l xml:id="m-85d02edb-27a6-4847-b0eb-a8b194ec6059" facs="#m-3937dc85-9756-454b-b823-7864779b7f2f" label="lyrics-like">vocátur Zelôtes, et Judam Jacóbi,</l><l xml:id="m-552378e4-d94d-421a-ba1c-4413b4d8afe4" facs="#m-4a697a62-c633-444d-a6e8-42178fbe5f73" label="ambiguous">omnes.</l><l xml:id="m-1aa90e71-71bc-45e6-8268-2658e883e6bc" facs="#m-7b8758af-f3c7-4af1-843f-6085dd2b32f2" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-d4e78a13-4913-42eb-b857-b70460befb3a" facs="#m-b7ef92cd-b7be-4f2a-855b-1792116419cb" label="lyrics-like">et Judam Iscariótem, qui fuit pró¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b9230e1-8d84-438a-8dcc-c04ff8f06f50" facs="#m-0a3cb408-6253-45e8-a510-51837f928cd8" label="ambiguous">Offertory. Mihi autem. 1306.</l><l xml:id="m-5fee49ae-5d86-4d2a-ad80-94138a790a5e" facs="#m-9a5fea1b-0fa3-4ccb-b1c8-f922c7635685" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-a92f9107-5d9f-40be-bd9e-07ebb5c5adbc" facs="#m-217b3c41-c5c7-480c-8fdd-184f2dff43e8" label="lyrics-like">2Eáti Apóstoli tui Bartholomaéi beneficia capiámus, pro quo tibi</l><l xml:id="m-9c8a7ac8-ae25-4e7d-8f2b-0a7af98f9683" facs="#m-db03dc0b-8acf-497c-988a-24a626e5e893" label="lyrics-like">D solémnia recenséntes, quaésu- laudis hóstias immolámus. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ba3a32b-faf3-43d4-8330-33f4094df5af" facs="#m-4d684a17-e712-46f0-85ea-2c7e20fac84c" label="lyrics-like">mus Dómine; ut ejus auxilio tual minum.</l><l xml:id="m-91e867cd-2dff-40c5-bf79-873cb1f45003" facs="#m-eb612bef-73a3-452d-a00a-c9577fce77f6" label="text-like">Preface of the Apostles, p. 10.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
